    ('july-04', 'july-04-extra-dictation-3', 33, 'Listen & Speak', 'listenType', '{"id":"july-04-extra-dictation-3","format":"listenType","type":"listenType","section":"Listen & Speak","topic":"responses","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Focus on the responses meaning. Look for the sentence that expresses “どういたしまして。”.","hintJa":"お礼への自然な返答。","explanation":"The complete sentence is “Don’t mention it.”. Listen for every short grammar word as well as the key expression.","explanationJa":"全文は「Don’t mention it.」です。中心表現だけでなく、短い文法語まで聞き取りましょう。","prompt":"Type the complete sentence you hear.","promptJa":"聞こえた英文をそのまま入力してください。","audioText":"Don’t mention it.","accepted":["Don’t mention it."]}'::jsonb, false, 1),
