    ('july-05', 'july-05-extra-visual-5', 45, 'See It', 'situation', '{"id":"july-05-extra-visual-5","format":"situation","type":"situation","section":"See It","topic":"choices","isOriginal":false,"hint":"Use the visible action and objects as evidence: A person happily accepts either of two appointment options. Choose the sentence that describes the complete scene.","hintJa":"人物の動作や物を確認し、「どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。」に合う場面か考えましょう。見えている場面全体を説明する英文を選んでください。","explanation":"The illustration shows this scene: A person happily accepts either of two appointment options. That directly matches “Either option works for me.” (どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。); the other choices describe different actions or situations.","explanationJa":"人物の動作や物が「どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。」という場面を表しています。そのため「Either option works for me.」が一致し、他の選択肢は別の動作・場面です。","prompt":"Which sentence best matches the illustration?","promptJa":"イラストの場面に最も合う英文を選んでください。","choices":[{"id":"a","en":"Either option works for me.","jp":"どちらの選択肢でも大丈夫です。"},{"id":"b","en":"I’d rather stay home tonight.","jp":"今夜は家にいたいです。"},{"id":"c","en":"It depends on the weather.","jp":"天気によります。"},{"id":"d","en":"I changed my mind.","jp":"考えが変わりました。"}],"correct":"a","image":"/assets/questions/visual/july-05-05-either-option.webp","imageAlt":"A person happily accepts either of two appointment options.","visualAssetId":"july-05-05"}'::jsonb, false, 1),
